        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: shorten recovery-small test_52 run time",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: shorten recovery-small test_52 run time\n\nrecovery-small test_52 ran writemany for 300 seconds per\nfailover, spending most of its time waiting for the writer.\nA fixed shorter duration can end before a slow failover\ncompletes and leave recovery without the intended load.\n\nRestart writemany in 30-second intervals while a client-local\nsentinel exists. Remove the sentinel after failover and let\nthe current run finish, preserving its exit status without\nterminating active I/O. This bounds the final wait without\nlimiting how long the failover can take.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small env=ONLY=52\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Idd82a60d41e181d755661e0ccf307a113527a552\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69383\nReviewed-by: Jian Yu <yujian@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
